  quote="It is impossible at present to trace the history of the uniformity of the school tradition ... The first true indication of conscious state reform of the schooling system most probably took place during the reign of Sulgi of Ur, who, in addition to practical administrative reforms, claims to have established schools in Nippur and in Ur.",
